{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Dataset Structure Check.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Dataset Structure Check.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"dataset structure check dataset structure check","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Dataset Structure Check.md","fileName":"Dataset Structure Check.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Dataset Structure Check","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 18:44\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Analytic Data Preparation]] · [[R Data Ingestion and Review]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Analytic Data Preparation","R Data Ingestion and Review","analyzinghealthdatainrforsasusers.pdf","essentialsofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Dataset Structure Check.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Dataset Structure Check.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"dataset structure check dataset structure check","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Dataset Structure Check.md","fileName":"Dataset Structure Check.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Dataset Structure Check","heading":"Dataset Structure Check","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A dataset structure check verifies the shape and schema of data immediately after import. It compares observed row and column counts, names, classes, storage modes, levels, and missingness with the expected metadata.\n\nThis check catches silent transformations such as renamed variables, unexpected factor conversion, or a source field read with the wrong type. Later statistical output cannot repair a mismatch introduced at import, so structural validation belongs at the beginning of the pipeline.\n\nThe book operationalizes structure review through dimensions, a compact glimpse, first and last records, and random rows. These complementary views expose both schema-wide problems and malformed observations that a single preview might miss.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Analytic Data Preparation","R Data Ingestion and Review","analyzinghealthdatainrforsasusers.pdf","essentialsofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Dataset Structure Check.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Dataset Structure Check.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"dataset structure check dataset structure check","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Dataset Structure Check.md","fileName":"Dataset Structure Check.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Dataset Structure Check","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[analyzinghealthdatainrforsasusers.pdf]]\n\n[[essentialsofdatascience.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Analytic Data Preparation","R Data Ingestion and Review","analyzinghealthdatainrforsasusers.pdf","essentialsofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}